#, fuzzy
msgid "Google Cloud Functions (Serverless) with Quarkus REST, Undertow, or Reactive Routes"
msgstr "结合 Quarkus REST、Undertow 或 Reactive Routes 的 Google Cloud Functions（无服务器）"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `quarkus-google-cloud-functions-http` extension allows you to write microservices with Quarkus REST (Jakarta REST),\n"
"Undertow (Servlet), Reactive Routes, or xref:funqy-http.adoc[Funqy HTTP], and make these microservices deployable to the Google Cloud Functions runtime."
msgstr "`quarkus-google-cloud-functions-http` 扩展允许您使用 Quarkus REST（Jakarta REST）、Undertow（Servlet）、Reactive Routes 或 xref:funqy-http.adoc[Funqy HTTP] 编写微服务，并将这些微服务部署到 Google Cloud Functions 运行时环境中。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "One Google Cloud Functions deployment can represent any number of Jakarta REST, Servlet, Reactive Routes, or xref:funqy-http.adoc[Funqy HTTP] endpoints."
msgstr "一个 Google Cloud Functions 部署可以代表任意数量的 Jakarta REST、Servlet、Reactive Routes 或 xref:funqy-http.adoc[Funqy HTTP] 端点。"

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr "这项技术被认为是{extension-status}。"

msgid ""
"In _preview_, backward compatibility and presence in the ecosystem is not guaranteed.\n"
"Specific improvements might require changing configuration or APIs, and plans to become _stable_ are under way.\n"
"Feedback is welcome on our https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list] or as issues in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub issue tracker]."
msgstr "在 _preview(预览)_ 中，不保证向后兼容和在生态系统中的存在。具体的改进可能需要改变配置或API，并且正在计划变得 _稳定_ 。欢迎在我们的 link:https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[邮件列表] 中提供反馈，或在我们的 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub问题列表] 中提出问题。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr "如需查看所有可能状态的完整列表，请参阅我们的 link:https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[常见问题解答] 。"

